'''Death Step''' is a [[Fighting Styles|fighting style]] obtainable in the [[Second Sea|Second]] and [[Third Sea|Third Seas]].

Death Step is the upgraded version of [[Dark Step]], making it significantly more powerful in many aspects. It enhances the user's legs even further, now letting them wield extremely fast attacks.

While this [[Fighting Styles|Fighting Style]] is equipped, [[Aura]] stages are based on the user's legs instead of their arms while activated. This is entirely visual and provides no buffs apart from regular [[Aura]] buffs.

==Obtainment==
Death Step can be learned from [[Phoeyu, the Reformed]], by meeting the following requirements:
* [[Library Key]], that can be dropped by the [[Awakened Ice Admiral]] but the chances are low.
** Used to unlock the door on the right side of the hallway entrance in [[Ice Castle]].
*** If the door is not unlocked, the player will not be able to learn Death Step by talking to [[Phoeyu, the Reformed|Phoeyu]], even if the user flash steps in.
* [[Dark Step]] mastery must be 400 or above.
* {{Money|2,500,000}}
* {{Fragment|5,000}}
The "{{Title|Burning Leg}}" [[Titles|title]] #129 will be granted upon obtaining this fighting style.

==Mastery==
* '''400+ Mastery:''' Death Step is one of the requirements to obtain [[Godhuman]] in [[Third Sea]].

